<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA V SRI LANKA BOARD XI SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SRI LANKA BOARD XI SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
